<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ZEP" style="id">Zephaniah</book>
  <para style="h">Zephaniah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zephaniah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zephaniah</para>
  <para style="mt">Zephaniah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hi thu in Amon tapa Josiah ii Judah kumpi a sep laitak, Topa ii Zephaniah tungah a piak thu ahi hi- (Zephaniah pa Cushi, Cushi pa Gedaliah, Gedaliah pa Amariah hi a, Amariah pa sia Kumpi Hezekiah ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in, “Keima in leitung na theampo ka lalsak tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />mihing le nganhing, vacim le ngasa dongin ka susia tu hi. Mi ngilote bo natu ka vawt tu hi. Mihing nam buppi ka susia tu a, kuama taang ngawl tu hi. Keima Topa in ka son zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Jerusalem mite le Judah mite theampo daan ka pia tu hi. Baal biakna a khakbel te dongin ka bosak siat tu a, tua nasep a seam lawki thiampite zongh kuama in phawk ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Innkhum tungah kaato in, ni, tha, aksite a bia pawpo ka susia tu hi. Kei hong bia hong paai in, a thumaan tu in kiciam pia zo napi, a zawk ciang Molech pathian min suangin a kiciam theampo ka susia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kei hong nungngat in, kei hong zui nawn ngawlte, kei tungah lamlak natu ngen ngawl a, hong zuan ngawlte ka susia tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa thukhen tu ni hong nai zo hi; tua ahikom ama mai ah thim dide in om vun. Topa in a mite pum aap siat tu in kithoai a, Judah a suttol tu in ngalte sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in, “Tua kingawlup ni in, uliante, kumpi tapate le ngamdang ngeinate a zui theampo daan ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lawkite bangin biakna a vawt theampo le sutol vanh taw a tote inn sung a kidim natu in, a ngute le a thatte theampo daan ka pia tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in, “Tua ni ciang, Jerusalem Ngasa Kongpi ah kaana aw na za tu uh hi. Khuapi khen a thak zawna munah tauna aw le mual tungah sukthapna awnging lian khat na za tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />No, khuapi taw sangah a teangte awng, hi thu na zaak uh ciang tau in kap vun, banghang ziam cile sumvawtte theampo thi siat tu uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tua hun ciang in meiinn khat la in, Jerusalem ka zong tu hi. Amate le amate tumtakin lungkim a, a kimuang mite in, ‘ Topa in a pha, a sia bangma vawt nei ngei bo’ a cite daan ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate nei le lamh kisuttol in, a innte kisusia tu hi. Amate in a sak tu innte sungah teang ngeingawl tu a, a ciin tu sapitkungte pan sapittui ne ngeingawl tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa ii Ni a thupi sia hong nai zo hi — hong nai mama zo a, manlang takin hong theng tu hi! Tua ni in a thuak hak ni hi tu hi, banghang ziam cile, ngalkap hangsan belte zongh thinkiamin kap tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ni sia thinso ni khat, ngim nga ni le thinkiam ni khat hi tu a, siatna le lalna ni khat, khuazing le khuasia ni khat, meeikaai a, khuatuap ni khat hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Luphungte taw a kidal khuapite le tausaangte a sim ngalkapte ii ngal kisimna awnging le ngal lemle aw taw a kidim ni hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa in, “Mihingte tungah tuabang tuasiatna ka tungsak tu a, a vekpi in mittawte bangin lei a zawt tu uh hi. Amate in kei tungah hong maw zo ahikom tu in a chisan uh tui bang in luang tu a, a mithi luangte lei ah kisial in a muat tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ni in Topa in a thinsona hong lak ciang a ngunn a khamh te theampo zongin amate a hun zo buatu hi. Leitung bup sia a thin uukna meikuang in susia tu hi. Leitung a teang mihing theampo bona — thakhat thu in a bona — ama in tungsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A maizum maw minam awng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />note vui ii muut taangvai bangin hong kibet ma, Topa thin uukna a kuang sia hong thet ma, ama thinsona hong lak ma in khua hong phawk tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama ii thupiakte a ni, ngam sungah a kiniamkhiak note theampo awng, Topa sangah hong kiheak tavun. A maan sia vawt vun a, Topa mai ah noma le noma kiniamkhiak vun. Tua hile Topa ii a thin uukna hong lak ni ciangin daan khak natu pan suakta tha tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gaza khuapi ah a kinusia kuama om ngawl tu hi. Ashkelon kitaisan tu hi. Ni lang sungah Ashdod mite kihawlkeak tu hi, tuaciang Ekron mite sia amate khuapi pan kihawlkeak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuipi hui ah a teang no Philistine mite awng, a lal hi zo nu hi. Topa in no tungah thukhen zo hi. Ama in hong susia tu a, khat zongh na taang buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuipi hui na ngam uh sia tuucingte bukte le tuukhawkte omna lozau suak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Judah mi a nungta laiteng in na leitang uh la tu hi. Amate in a ngan honte thana in nei tu a, Ashkelon innte ah ngiak tu uh hi. Topa a Pathian in amate taw omkhawm tu a, amate nuamsasak kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa Vaanglianbelpa in, “Moab le Ammon mite in ka mite a zawnsakna, a nomuna le, a ngam ka sut tu hi ci in a kiphatsakna zongh ka za zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel te ii Pathian, a nungta Topa ka hi bangma in Moab le Ammon sia Sodom le Gomorrah bangin kisusia tu hi, ci in ka kiciam hi. Tuate sia cikhukte le a laltham top, lopa bek pona mun suak tu hi. Ka mi a nungta laite in amate vanh suttol tu a, a ngam laaksak tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Moab le Ammon mite kiphatsakna, a kisaktheina le vaanglianbelpa Topa ii mite a selno hu in daan a piak tu zia sia tuabang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in amate lausak tu hi. Ama in leitung pathiante sia bangma ngawl suaksak tu a, tua zawkciang minam theampo in amate ngam tek ah ama bia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in Ethiopia mite zongh thisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa in Assyria suksiat natu in a vaangletna zangh tu hi. Ama in Nineveh khuapi sia a lalsa a kinusia sa, tui om ngawl sennealngam suaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua mun in tuuhon, khuihon le nganhing namcin tatna mun hi tu hi. Tua a lalsa munah simbute teangin khelkite panin haam tu hi. Kongkha saamkiil tungah va-akte haam tu hi. A inn sakna thingkal ahi cedar thingte kilakeak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khuapi kiphasak mama, a thahatna suangin, ngam muang a kisa khat tungah tuabangin piang tu hi. A mite in amate khuapi sia simleitung ah khuapi lianbelin ngaisun uh hi. Bangza a ngamtongta mun, ngamsate tawl omna mun suak tu ziam! A kaantan in a pai pawpo in a mu ciang patau in ton tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A mite a zothaw, tatsia in ngalphuang nuam Jerusalem khuapi a lal hi zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua sia in Topa thu ngai ngawl a, a kiteknate zongh saang ngawl hi. Topa muang ngawlin, huna zongh ngen ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A uliante sia tawpi hawk bang hi a; a thukhenmangte sia, duhop leih kisa in a zing ciang dong sangu khat zongh a khe ngam ngawl ngiapui ngilkialte bang ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kamsaangte in sep nop vacin nei ngawl a, thimthel uh hi; thiampite in a thiangtho nate ninsak in, Pathian thukhamte amate phattuam natu in deikai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahihang khuapi sungah Topa om lai hi; ama in a maan bang seam a, a hi ngawlte vawt ngeingawl hi. Zing sim a pealmaw in a mite tungah thutang lak hi. Tua hi napi thutang ngawl mite in a maan ngawlte ma vawt tan viuveu a, a mai uh zum ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in “Minam theampo ka maaimot zo hi; a khuapite ka susia a, a luphungte le a tausaangte a siacip sa in ka nusia hi. A khuapite kitaisan a; lampite a tawn om ngawl a — mihingte kuama om nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka ngaisutna ah tuasia ciang ka mite in kei hong thasia tu a, tuaciang ka tek nate hong saang tu hi, ka hilnate mangil ngeingawl tu hi ci in ka tuat hi. Ahihang hai ngawlin a ngamtat siat ngei ma in, a sia ngamta veve uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in, “Ngak zi vun, ka minamte ka mawsak tu ni ngak vun. Ka thin uukna ii thahatna ka heaksak nopna in minamte le kumpi ngamte khoptua tu in ka thin ka khensat zo hi. Ka thinsona meikuang in simlei bup ka kaanghthamsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tua sia ciang ngam tuatuamte sungah mihingte ka kikhealsak tu a, amate in kei tung bek ah thu hong ngen in pathian dangte tungah thungen nawn ngawl tu hi. Amate a vekpi in keima thu hong ni tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngam khuala Ethiopia pan ngawngawnin a kithethaang ka mite in kei tungah biakpiakna hong pia tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua hun ciang, kei nong langpan huvau in no ka mite in na maizum tu kul nawn ngawl tu uh hi. A kiphasak le a kisathei theampo ka heam tu a, ka mual thiangtho tungah kei nong do kik ngei nawn buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A kiniamkhiak, a thinnip mite tualai ah ka nusia tu a, kei kungah hu ngenin hong pai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A taanglai Israel mite in kuama tungah khial ngawl tu a, leilot thu son ngawlin ngual a theam buatu uh hi. Amate ma vang daupai in ngammuang tu a, kuama a kiita buatu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel mite awng, Lungdamna taw lasa in au vun! Jerusalem awng, na thin theampo taw lungdam vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa in na daan thuakna bosak zo hi; Na ngalte theampo hong hepsak hi. Topa , Israel kumpipa sia note taw omkhawm hi; tu in bangma lau natu thu om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jerusalem tungah amate ii hi bangin a ci tu hun hong theng tu hi, “Lau heak in, Zion khuapi awng! Na khutte zawsak in khia vanuang heak in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa na Pathian in nang taw omkhawm hi; ama ii thahatna in zawna hong pia hi; Topa in nang tungah lungdam tu hi, tuaciang ama ii itna sungah nuntakna thak hong pia tu hi. Ama in lasa tu a, na tungah lungdam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mihingte poai khat sungah a lungdam bangma hi tu hi.” Topa in “Lal natu hong tawnnate ka vengsak zo hi; tuaciang na min daina teng kong laaksak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A hun hong theng tu hi! Nang hong zothawte daan ka pia tu hi; a peangbai theampo ka suatak tu a tuaciang saltaangte inn ah ka ciapui tu hi. Amate ii maizumna sia patoaina taw ka laih tu hi; tuaciang leitung theampo in amate pok tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A hun hong tung tu hi! A kithethaang na mite inn ah kong ciapui tu hi; Simleitung bup ah na min kong thangsak tu a, tuaciang khatvei a khangto a nuamsa in kong vawt kik tu hi,” ci hi. Topa in ci zo hi.
  </para>
</usx>
